#. :src: bpy.types.ShaderNodeWireframe
msgid ""
"Retrieve the edges of an object as it appears to Cycles.\n"
"Note: as meshes are triangulated before being processed by Cycles, topology "
"will always appear triangulated"
msgstr ""
"Hämta ett objekts kanter såsom Cycles uppfattar dem.\n"
"Obs: Eftersom meshar trianguleras innan de bearbetas av Cycles visas "
"topologin alltid triangulerad"

#. :src: bpy.types.SCENE_OT_freestyle_fill_range_by_selection
msgid ""
"Fill the Range Min/Max entries by the min/max distance between selected mesh "
"objects and the source object (either a user-specified object or the active "
"camera)"
msgstr ""
"Fyll i Min-/Max-fälten med minimi-/maximiavståndet mellan valda meshobjekt "
"och källobjektet (antingen ett användardefinierat objekt eller den aktiva "
"kameran)"

#. :src: bpy.types.WM_OT_context_cycle_array
msgid ""
"Set a context array value (useful for cycling the active mesh edit mode)"
msgstr ""
"Ställ in ett kontextmatrisvärde (användbart för att växla mellan aktiva "
"meshredigeringslägen)"

#. :src: bpy.types.RIGIDBODY_OT_shape_change.type:'CONVEX_HULL'
#. :src: bpy.types.RigidBodyObject.collision_shape:'CONVEX_HULL'
msgid ""
"A mesh-like surface encompassing (i.e. shrinkwrap over) all vertices (best "
"results with fewer vertices)"
msgstr ""
"En meshliknande yta som omsluter alla hörnpunkter (ungefär som krympfilm; "
"bäst resultat med färre hörnpunkter)"

#. :src: bpy.types.SCULPT_OT_mesh_filter.type:'RELAX'
msgid "Relax mesh"
msgstr "Jämna ut mesh"

#. :src: bpy.types.WM_OT_obj_export.export_triangulated_mesh
#. :src: bpy.types.WM_OT_ply_export.export_triangulated_mesh
msgid ""
"All ngons with four or more vertices will be triangulated. Meshes in the "
"scene will not be affected. Behaves like Triangulate Modifier with ngon-"
"method: \"Beauty\", quad-method: \"Shortest Diagonal\", min vertices: 4"
msgstr ""
"Alla n-goner med fyra eller fler hörnpunkter trianguleras. Mesharna i scenen "
